{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/subterra_about.png?t=1746243326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/SubTerraGameplay1.gif?t=1746243326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Sub Terra</u></strong> is a single-player first person psychological horror game inspired by The Backrooms. As a maintenance worker, you've spent your whole life venturing deep underground to repair pipes, gas lines, you name it. Utilities that we take for granted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On a day like any other, you enter the manhole and descend the depths to replace a water line at the end of tunnel <strong><i>04-R</i></strong>. The job is straightforward. The directions are clear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But your repair doesn't go quite as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/subterra_getingetout.png?t=1746243326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/SubTerraGameplay2.gif?t=1746243326\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> Realistic graphics and spatialized audio create a truly immersive experience guaranteed to make you feel like you're really 50 feet under.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unravel a Mystery: </strong>Piece together hints and clues to learn the tragic story of what's been buried underground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep an Eye Out: </strong>You know the tunnels like the back of your hand, but you're not the only thing down there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Locations: </strong>Your job may be down a manhole, but you'll discover <strong>much more</strong> than just maintenance tunnels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warning: <strong><u>Sub Terra</u></strong> contains loud noises, flashing lights and material that may be disturbing to some individuals.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3696090?t=1746243326","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/95b6c09337bc6c03611094ad84063533c7716064/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746243326","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/615f44d58fb1cde0d7d04f77bb52889b451679ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746243326","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/615f44d58fb1cde0d7d04f77bb52889b451679ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746243326","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains blood and psychological horror themes"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/subterra_about.png?t=1746243326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/SubTerraGameplay1.gif?t=1746243326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Sub Terra</u></strong> is a single-player first person psychological horror game inspired by The Backrooms. As a maintenance worker, you've spent your whole life venturing deep underground to repair pipes, gas lines, you name it. Utilities that we take for granted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On a day like any other, you enter the manhole and descend the depths to replace a water line at the end of tunnel <strong><i>04-R</i></strong>. The job is straightforward. The directions are clear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But your repair doesn't go quite as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/subterra_getingetout.png?t=1746243326\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/SubTerraGameplay2.gif?t=1746243326\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> Realistic graphics and spatialized audio create a truly immersive experience guaranteed to make you feel like you're really 50 feet under.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unravel a Mystery: </strong>Piece together hints and clues to learn the tragic story of what's been buried underground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep an Eye Out: </strong>You know the tunnels like the back of your hand, but you're not the only thing down there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Locations: </strong>Your job may be down a manhole, but you'll discover <strong>much more</strong> than just maintenance tunnels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warning: <strong><u>Sub Terra</u></strong> contains loud noises, flashing lights and material that may be disturbing to some individuals.</p>","developers":["artescape"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/6888ab48b12a28b4958b242c2717649b17f3aede/header.jpg?t=1746243326","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130146,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130146/movie480.mp4?t=1746243324",